  "title": "Short Ribs Braised with Mushrooms and Tomatoes",
  "description": "Chef John's slow-braised short ribs with porcini mushroom and tomatoes cook until meltingly tender and irresistible. Serve over potatoes or polenta.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
